5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,We need to assess the reliability of our current infrastructure before choosing.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I am worried about how location affects who can actually reach these services.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,The funding structure often looks fine now but fails later. We must check that.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,We keep proposing new things without looking at what we already tried and failed.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I am concerned about whether our staff have the skills for any new role.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
