12,1,2,talk,George,,I will look into the grant terms and the endowment to see the shape.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,I want to check the attendance sheets from our old outreach stops.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I will check the volunteer register to see who is actually available.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will look into the winter road closures to understand access issues.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
