35,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The road closures were bad, but the community halls kept their timetables.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Yumi,,The bus links are gone in the outer wards. People face an hour's trip.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,George,,"The grant only covers twelve months. After that, the flat budget takes over.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,The old outreach stops had forty visitors a session. That is higher than midweek here.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"We have retired tradespeople volunteering, but no one is trained to supervise them.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@George, does that mean the funding collapses after year one?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"@May, so the demand was there, but we stopped?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,George,,"Yes, the capital items draw on the endowment, but operations are flat.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,Exactly. We have a proven model that we abandoned.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,The tool certification lapsed when the technician retired. That is a gap.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,The delivery windows for scanning slip if big clients book first.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Yumi,,"Remote catalogue use peaks after nine, but we lock up at nine.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,George,,The vehicle running line overran by a third last year. That is a warning.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,The digitisation batch from six years ago is half unindexed.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,The neighbourhood associations staff their own sessions. They are self-sufficient.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
