60,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Candidate D, the Mobile Branch, addresses the access gap I found.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Yumi,,"I agree. The bus links are gone, so a mobile service is essential.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,George,,But the vehicle running costs overran last year. Is it sustainable?,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,May,,The attendance data shows high demand in those outer wards.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,"We have staff for the help desk, but do we have the drivers?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@George, the grant covers the first year, but we need a long-term plan.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Yumi,,The community halls kept their timetables despite road closures. We can too.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,George,,I am worried about the second year budget. It looks thin.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,May,,We tried this before and it worked. Why did we stop?,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,"The volunteer register shows people willing to help, but supervision is missing.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,The mobile service is the only one that directly fixes the access problem.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Yumi,,I support D. It reaches the people who cannot come to us.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,George,,"I am hesitant, but the data supports the need. I will vote D.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,May,,I vote D. It is the proven model we should restart.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I am unsure about the staffing, but I will vote D for the community.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
